# Gowin network device configuration

config NET_VENDOR_GOWIN
	bool "Gowin devices"
	default y
	depends on OF
	help
	  If you have a network (Ethernet) device belonging to this class,
	  say Y.

	  Note that the answer to this question doesn't directly affect the
	  kernel: saying N will just cause the configurator to skip all the
	  questions about Gowin devices. If you say Y, you will be asked for
	  your specific device in the following questions.

if NET_VENDOR_GOWIN

config GOWIN_TSE
	tristate "Gowin Triple-Speed Ethernet (PIO) support"
	depends on OF && HAS_IOMEM
	select PHYLIB
	help
	  Driver for the Gowin Triple-Speed Ethernet MAC as integrated on the
	  AE350 SoC (Tang Mega 138K Pro Dock). The MAC uses a programmed-I/O
	  frame window (no DMA descriptors). To compile as a module choose M.

endif # NET_VENDOR_GOWIN
